/*
 * Declares the MapAccessValue class.
 *
 * MapAccessValue represents a key-based access on a map value. The operator
 * applies a key expression to a map operand and retrieves the value associated
 * with that key. The semantics of lookup, missing-key behavior, and mutability
 * follow the rules defined by the map type.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::map::access
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/map/access.yr
 * @Author(s):
